  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 508.09 Advertising and Promotion. Agency stores shall be subject to the same restrictions on advertising and promotion that apply to off-premises combination licenses and retail wine licenses found in RSA 179.\n\nSource. #5261, eff 10-30-91, 10-30-97\n\nNew. #6666, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #9966, eff 7-29-11; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
